        "start_offset": 36,
        "end_offset": 74,
        "physical_page": null,
        "origin_kind": "original",
        "supplement_id": null,
        "text": "算法：先单独读取余额，计算后写回；给定初值100，一次加20、一次减10。\n"
      },
